Adapted components
==================

* HAT Analyzer_Execution / Analyzer_Datasets: Fabio Delogu and Flavio Pignone,
  CIMA Research Foundation; legacy monitoring/publication formats and figure examples.
* RULER - RUntime anaLyzER: Fabio Delogu, CIMA Research Foundation, Department of
  Hydrology and Hydraulics. The integrated Ruler implementation retains the upstream
  MIT licence and revision provenance in shybox/monitoring_toolkit/resources/ruler/engine/.

Hydrapp is the SHYBOX Flask viewer, evolved from the earlier dashboard and HAT
publication examples. Component credits do not change their original licences.
